    "homeType": "SINGLE_FAMILY",
    "description": "Set on a peaceful block with sweeping panoramic outlooks yet just a short stroll to Castro Village, this bright and inviting home perfectly balances serenity with city living. The upper level features an open floor plan designed for today's lifestyle, filled with natural light and framed by expansive views. The living, dining and kitchen all flow seamlessly to a view deck, creating an ideal space for entertaining or relaxing. The spacious kitchen is thoughtfully appointed with an eat-in area, ample cabinetry, generous counter space, premium appliances & a designer Fireclay tile backsplash. 2 spacious bedrooms & a beautifully remodeled bathroom complete this level. Downstairs, two additional bedrooms & a full bathroom open to a large private backyard with deck, perfect for outdoor dining, gardening or simply unwinding. With 4 bedrooms in total, the home offers flexible options for a home office, guest space, or creative studio. Just 4 doors from Corona Heights Park with its trails, dog walking paths, Randall Museum & beautiful sunset views, you'll find nature at your doorstep. With Buena Vista Park, Castro Village shops & dining & the Castro MUNI station only a short walk away, this home delivers both tranquility & convenience in one of San Francisco's most coveted neighborhoods."
  },
